  \lq\lq The Pitfalls of Deciding Whether a Quantum Channel Is (Conjugate)
  Degradable and How to Avoid Them,\rq\rq{}
  \emph{Open Systems \& Information Dynamics} \textbf{22}, 1550026 (2015).
